WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.601
Using drones from the air

00:00:01.601 --> 00:00:03.737
and armored bulldozers on the ground.

00:00:03.737 --> 00:00:04.771
Israel is launching

00:00:04.771 --> 00:00:06.840
its largest military incursion

00:00:07.073 --> 00:00:08.375
into the occupied West

00:00:08.375 --> 00:00:10.777
Bank city of Janine in two decades.

00:00:15.248 --> 00:00:16.249
So Israel says

00:00:16.249 --> 00:00:17.484
the operation is focused

00:00:17.484 --> 00:00:19.652
on counterterrorism.

00:00:19.652 --> 00:00:20.320
Palestinians

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:22.489
call it a new war crime

00:00:22.489 --> 00:00:24.190
against our defenseless people.

00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:24.991
The Palestinian Health

00:00:24.991 --> 00:00:26.593
Ministry says at least eight

00:00:26.593 --> 00:00:27.761
people have been killed

00:00:27.761 --> 00:00:29.896
with that number likely to rise.

00:00:30.263 --> 00:00:32.565
And at least 50 others now injured

00:00:32.565 --> 00:00:34.367
Israel says it hit terrorist

00:00:34.367 --> 00:00:36.302
infrastructure in the densely

00:00:36.302 --> 00:00:38.171
populated Jenin refugee camp.

00:00:38.171 --> 00:00:40.106
The operation comes less than two weeks

00:00:40.106 --> 00:00:40.807
after a raid

00:00:40.807 --> 00:00:41.775
in the same area

00:00:41.775 --> 00:00:43.810
erupted into a massive firefight,

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:46.880
killing at least five Palestinians.

00:00:46.913 --> 00:00:47.647
We want to go straight

00:00:47.647 --> 00:00:49.516
to our how to school to joins us now

00:00:49.516 --> 00:00:50.717
live near Jerusalem.

00:00:50.717 --> 00:00:52.752
Obviously, this is a notable escalation

00:00:53.253 --> 00:00:53.887
Hadassah.

00:00:53.887 --> 00:00:55.922
Can you give us a sense of this operation

00:00:55.922 --> 00:00:57.090
both on the ground,

00:00:57.090 --> 00:00:59.125
but also in historical terms,

00:00:59.125 --> 00:01:00.660
given the uptick in violence

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:01.461
that you've covered now

00:01:01.461 --> 00:01:02.529
for the last 18 months?

00:01:04.764 --> 00:01:05.432
Yeah, we have been

00:01:05.432 --> 00:01:06.633
covering this regular

00:01:06.633 --> 00:01:07.967
sort of cycle of violence

00:01:07.967 --> 00:01:09.235
for the past 18 months.

00:01:09.235 --> 00:01:10.904
The Israeli military launching

00:01:10.904 --> 00:01:11.971
these regular raids

00:01:11.971 --> 00:01:13.406
into the occupied West Bank

00:01:13.406 --> 00:01:16.443
after a series of a Palestinian attacks.

00:01:16.443 --> 00:01:17.610
Targeting is really it's now

00:01:17.610 --> 00:01:18.611
the Israeli military

00:01:18.611 --> 00:01:19.012
saying that

00:01:19.012 --> 00:01:20.480
they're going into the West Bank

00:01:20.480 --> 00:01:22.582
to try to prevent militants from

00:01:22.582 --> 00:01:24.150
from being able to later

00:01:24.150 --> 00:01:25.018
carry out attacks.

00:01:25.018 --> 00:01:26.886
But it just seems to be perpetuating

00:01:26.886 --> 00:01:28.088
the cycle of violence.

00:01:28.088 --> 00:01:28.988
And we have been reporting

00:01:28.988 --> 00:01:30.723
it seemingly time and time again

00:01:30.723 --> 00:01:31.891
about how everything we're seeing

00:01:31.891 --> 00:01:32.792
is once again

00:01:32.792 --> 00:01:33.460
reminiscent

00:01:33.460 --> 00:01:34.928
of the days of the second intifada,

00:01:34.928 --> 00:01:36.362
when Israeli tanks were seen

00:01:36.362 --> 00:01:38.364
in the actual cities themselves

00:01:38.364 --> 00:01:39.566
and in the West Bank.

00:01:39.566 --> 00:01:40.066
But really,

00:01:40.066 --> 00:01:41.634
today is something new

00:01:41.634 --> 00:01:43.069
because it's been confirmed

00:01:43.069 --> 00:01:43.837
now from an Israeli

00:01:43.837 --> 00:01:44.537
military source

00:01:44.537 --> 00:01:46.639
telling CNN that this is the largest

00:01:46.906 --> 00:01:48.374
Israeli military operation

00:01:48.374 --> 00:01:50.110
in the West Bank since 2002.

00:01:50.110 --> 00:01:51.344
When you look at just

00:01:51.344 --> 00:01:53.546
the full number of soldiers,

00:01:53.546 --> 00:01:55.615
hundreds of sort of Israeli soldiers,

00:01:55.782 --> 00:01:57.450
the fact that they were using airstrikes

00:01:57.450 --> 00:01:58.051
from drones,

00:01:58.051 --> 00:01:59.986
we know of at least ten airstrikes

00:01:59.986 --> 00:02:02.088
that were being carried out in Jenin.

00:02:02.088 --> 00:02:04.090
When you look at the bulldozers

00:02:04.090 --> 00:02:06.025
that are tearing up streets on this,

00:02:06.025 --> 00:02:07.293
on the streets of Jenin now.

00:02:07.293 --> 00:02:08.294
Israeli military saying

00:02:08.294 --> 00:02:09.929
this is being done to

00:02:09.929 --> 00:02:10.964
to try and root out

00:02:10.964 --> 00:02:12.599
IEDs that militants place

00:02:12.599 --> 00:02:14.000
underneath the surface

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:14.934
level of the street.

00:02:14.934 --> 00:02:16.202
But obviously, that affects

00:02:16.202 --> 00:02:16.870
the civilians

00:02:16.870 --> 00:02:18.738
who are living there as well.

00:02:18.738 --> 00:02:21.574
And we are actually seeing Israeli tanks,

00:02:21.574 --> 00:02:22.575
not in Jenin itself,

00:02:22.575 --> 00:02:23.510
but on the outskirts

00:02:23.510 --> 00:02:24.711
outside the city limits.

00:02:24.711 --> 00:02:26.012
Again, these are not scenes

00:02:26.012 --> 00:02:27.847
that we are used to seeing here,

00:02:27.847 --> 00:02:29.415
at least not since the days

00:02:29.415 --> 00:02:30.783
of the second intifada.

00:02:30.783 --> 00:02:33.153
And, Paula, this is ongoing as we speak.

00:02:33.153 --> 00:02:34.487
We are still getting reports

00:02:34.487 --> 00:02:35.655
of firefights.

00:02:35.655 --> 00:02:36.489
The Israeli military

00:02:36.489 --> 00:02:36.856
saying that

00:02:36.856 --> 00:02:38.791
they just in the last hour, 2 hours

00:02:38.791 --> 00:02:39.526
or so, were engaged

00:02:39.526 --> 00:02:41.194
in firefights with militants at a mosque.

00:02:41.194 --> 00:02:42.162
They say that they discovered

00:02:42.162 --> 00:02:43.596
some underground tunnels under them,

00:02:43.596 --> 00:02:45.665
also being used to store weapons.

00:02:45.665 --> 00:02:46.933
We are getting reports of potentially

00:02:46.933 --> 00:02:48.601
even further airstrikes.

00:02:48.601 --> 00:02:51.037
This has now been going on for or for

00:02:51.437 --> 00:02:52.939
definitely more than 12 hours.

00:02:52.939 --> 00:02:53.640
Think we're approaching now

00:02:53.640 --> 00:02:55.241
16 hours of this operation.

00:02:55.241 --> 00:02:57.110
And yet still the Israeli military

00:02:57.110 --> 00:02:58.945
saying that it is not necessarily

00:02:58.945 --> 00:03:00.280
a large scale operation

00:03:00.280 --> 00:03:01.581
against the entire West Bank.

00:03:01.581 --> 00:03:03.283
They say they are focused on Jenin

00:03:03.283 --> 00:03:04.617
and that they want to essentially

00:03:04.617 --> 00:03:06.119
prevent Jenin from once again

00:03:06.119 --> 00:03:07.086
becoming what they call

00:03:07.086 --> 00:03:09.689
a safe haven for militants.

00:03:09.889 --> 00:03:11.858
Now, we are hearing that at least eight

00:03:11.858 --> 00:03:13.726
Palestinians have been killed.

00:03:13.726 --> 00:03:14.561
There have been some reports

00:03:14.561 --> 00:03:15.161
that some of them

00:03:15.161 --> 00:03:16.029
at least are militants,

00:03:16.029 --> 00:03:17.163
but no militant group

00:03:17.163 --> 00:03:19.032
has claimed them yet as their own.

00:03:19.032 --> 00:03:20.533
We know of at least 50

00:03:20.533 --> 00:03:21.334
who have been injured.

00:03:21.334 --> 00:03:22.135
One Israeli

00:03:22.135 --> 00:03:24.504
soldier has been injured as well.

00:03:24.537 --> 00:03:26.139
But of course, for the civilians there,

00:03:26.139 --> 00:03:28.308
I was actually just in Jenin yesterday

00:03:28.308 --> 00:03:30.109
on the ground talking to residents

00:03:30.109 --> 00:03:31.711
they today are saying this is something

00:03:31.711 --> 00:03:33.646
they have never seen before

00:03:33.646 --> 00:03:35.815
or at least have not seen in decades now.

00:03:36.015 --> 00:03:37.116
The White House has said

00:03:37.116 --> 00:03:38.551
that they are closely monitoring

00:03:38.551 --> 00:03:39.185
the situation.

00:03:39.185 --> 00:03:40.220
They did say broadly

00:03:40.220 --> 00:03:41.120
they support

00:03:41.120 --> 00:03:42.589
Israel's security

00:03:42.589 --> 00:03:44.591
and its fight against terrorism.

00:03:44.591 --> 00:03:46.326
But there is a concern

00:03:46.326 --> 00:03:47.627
that this will spill over

00:03:47.627 --> 00:03:49.028
into something much broader

00:03:49.028 --> 00:03:50.230
that this will spillover

00:03:50.230 --> 00:03:51.564
across the West Bank.

00:03:51.564 --> 00:03:52.232
We've already heard

00:03:52.232 --> 00:03:53.399
from the militant group Hamas.

00:03:53.399 --> 00:03:54.734
It has called on its members,

00:03:54.734 --> 00:03:56.669
on its cells to strike Israel.

00:03:56.669 --> 00:03:59.005
It said, wherever it can, Paula.

00:04:00.006 --> 00:04:00.773
Yes, certainly.

00:04:00.773 --> 00:04:01.441
I'm glad

00:04:01.441 --> 00:04:02.041
that you could put that

00:04:02.041 --> 00:04:03.977
into historical perspective.

00:04:03.977 --> 00:04:04.611
As you said,

00:04:04.611 --> 00:04:05.678
more than two decades

00:04:05.678 --> 00:04:06.713
in terms of this escalation.

00:04:06.713 --> 00:04:07.947
We will continue to follow this

00:04:07.947 --> 00:04:08.948
developing story for us.

00:04:08.948 --> 00:04:10.049
Hadassah Gold for us.

00:04:10.049 --> 00:04:11.084
Appreciate your update.

00:04:11.084 --> 00:04:13.353
Time now for the exchange.

00:04:13.353 --> 00:04:14.520
Our next guest tweets

00:04:14.520 --> 00:04:15.922
that the Jenin refugee camp

00:04:15.922 --> 00:04:18.191
is about one square kilometer

00:04:18.191 --> 00:04:18.992
and about and home

00:04:18.992 --> 00:04:20.893
to about 13,000 people.

00:04:20.893 --> 00:04:21.561
I mean, think of that.

00:04:21.561 --> 00:04:23.196
It's incredibly crowded.

00:04:23.196 --> 00:04:24.664
And she says targeting this camp

00:04:24.664 --> 00:04:25.298
from the air

00:04:25.298 --> 00:04:28.434
and ground puts all residents at risk.

00:04:28.768 --> 00:04:30.570
Nora is a political analyst

00:04:30.570 --> 00:04:31.704
and a former spokesperson

00:04:31.704 --> 00:04:32.972
for the Palestinian Authority,

00:04:32.972 --> 00:04:33.840
and she joins me now

00:04:33.840 --> 00:04:36.342
live from Ramallah in the West Bank.

00:04:36.342 --> 00:04:37.844
I want to get right to what you know

00:04:37.844 --> 00:04:38.745
about the operation

00:04:38.745 --> 00:04:39.746
in the ground right now.

00:04:39.746 --> 00:04:40.413
What can you tell us

00:04:40.413 --> 00:04:42.181
about the operation itself

00:04:42.181 --> 00:04:43.616
and what are you hearing from your

00:04:43.616 --> 00:04:44.550
sources on the ground?

00:04:45.985 --> 00:04:46.953
Well, I can tell you that

00:04:46.953 --> 00:04:48.221
journalists have been struggling

00:04:48.221 --> 00:04:50.757
link to cover the story on the ground.

00:04:50.757 --> 00:04:52.091
They are

00:04:52.091 --> 00:04:54.227
they've come under direct fire

00:04:54.694 --> 00:04:56.396
themselves.

00:04:56.462 --> 00:04:58.831
The medical crews as you reported,

00:04:59.098 --> 00:05:01.501
have also had a lot of difficulty

00:05:01.501 --> 00:05:03.303
accessing the refugee camp

00:05:03.303 --> 00:05:04.637
and retrieving the injured

00:05:04.637 --> 00:05:07.640
or tending to those who need help.

00:05:07.640 --> 00:05:08.875
Including the elderly

00:05:08.875 --> 00:05:10.743
and the civilians trapped

00:05:10.743 --> 00:05:11.944
in the refugee camp

00:05:11.944 --> 00:05:13.146
during this operation,

00:05:13.146 --> 00:05:16.382
which is going on almost 16 hours now.

00:05:16.983 --> 00:05:18.951
And a lot of

00:05:18.951 --> 00:05:21.087
former colleagues who have covered

00:05:21.487 --> 00:05:24.357
who had covered the 2002 invasion

00:05:24.357 --> 00:05:25.391
of the refugee camp

00:05:25.391 --> 00:05:26.893
say the atmosphere

00:05:26.893 --> 00:05:28.261
is very reminiscent

00:05:28.261 --> 00:05:29.929
of that bloody episode

00:05:29.929 --> 00:05:30.730
when Israel killed

00:05:30.730 --> 00:05:32.799
over 60 Palestinians

00:05:32.799 --> 00:05:34.500
and basically pummeled

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:36.602
the refugee camp, destroyed it, leveled

00:05:36.869 --> 00:05:38.805
many of its neighborhood

00:05:38.805 --> 00:05:40.873
neighborhoods to the ground

00:05:40.873 --> 00:05:43.543
also under the very similar pretenses.

00:05:44.444 --> 00:05:45.211
You know, it's hard for us

00:05:45.211 --> 00:05:46.145
to actually get a read of what's

00:05:46.145 --> 00:05:46.646
going on the ground.

00:05:46.646 --> 00:05:47.447
We have live pictures

00:05:47.447 --> 00:05:48.348
right now of Janine.

00:05:48.348 --> 00:05:49.582
As you can see as the sun is setting,

00:05:49.582 --> 00:05:51.484
we still see smoke rising from there.

00:05:51.484 --> 00:05:52.652
The Israeli government

00:05:52.652 --> 00:05:53.653
believes that this operation

00:05:53.653 --> 00:05:54.887
will continue for some hours

00:05:54.887 --> 00:05:56.989
to come in terms of tactics here.

00:05:57.023 --> 00:05:58.991
What are you hearing as well?

00:05:58.991 --> 00:05:59.192
Sure.

00:05:59.192 --> 00:06:00.960
It's difficult for you to get information

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:01.594
because, you know,

00:06:01.594 --> 00:06:02.495
mobile Internet

00:06:02.495 --> 00:06:03.429
coverage is spotty,

00:06:03.429 --> 00:06:04.697
sometimes nonexistent.

00:06:04.697 --> 00:06:05.932
We just had that update

00:06:05.932 --> 00:06:06.999
from the Palestinian

00:06:06.999 --> 00:06:07.834
Red Crescent saying

00:06:07.834 --> 00:06:08.835
medical professionals

00:06:08.835 --> 00:06:09.802
were having a hard time

00:06:09.802 --> 00:06:11.204
getting to those injured.

00:06:11.204 --> 00:06:12.638
I mean, give us an indication

00:06:12.638 --> 00:06:14.707
of operationally what this will look like

00:06:14.941 --> 00:06:17.910
if you're inside such a crowded camp

00:06:17.910 --> 00:06:18.444
right now.

00:06:19.946 --> 00:06:21.447
Well, let me try to visualize

00:06:21.447 --> 00:06:22.615
this for the viewers.

00:06:22.615 --> 00:06:25.852
Basically, a large contingent of Israeli

00:06:25.852 --> 00:06:27.320
armored vehicles

00:06:27.320 --> 00:06:29.689
have gotten into the refugee camp.

00:06:29.689 --> 00:06:31.190
They've basically plowed

00:06:31.190 --> 00:06:32.291
many of the streets.

00:06:32.291 --> 00:06:34.360
They destroyed the water network,

00:06:34.360 --> 00:06:35.561
cut off electricity.

00:06:35.561 --> 00:06:36.662
So the residents

00:06:36.662 --> 00:06:38.431
now have no electricity,

00:06:38.431 --> 00:06:40.566
no water and nowhere to go.

00:06:41.267 --> 00:06:42.502
And many of the buildings

00:06:42.502 --> 00:06:44.737
have been taken over by Israeli soldiers

00:06:44.971 --> 00:06:47.240
to be used as sniper positions.

00:06:47.240 --> 00:06:50.643
So those who who have had the misfortune

00:06:50.643 --> 00:06:51.677
of Israeli soldiers

00:06:51.677 --> 00:06:52.845
taking over their home

00:06:52.845 --> 00:06:55.415
are now trapped in those homes.

00:06:55.848 --> 00:06:58.050
That is being used by Israeli soldiers

00:06:58.050 --> 00:07:01.320
to shoot at Palestinian activists.

00:07:01.320 --> 00:07:03.022
And I want to put this in perspective.

00:07:03.022 --> 00:07:04.991
If you if you allow me

00:07:04.991 --> 00:07:07.427
for Palestinians, these horrible scenes

00:07:08.127 --> 00:07:10.530
and these S.O.S.

00:07:10.530 --> 00:07:12.031
calls from paramedics

00:07:12.031 --> 00:07:13.166
and from journalists

00:07:13.166 --> 00:07:15.835
and from residents of the refugee camp

00:07:16.369 --> 00:07:18.638
are part of a very of a bigger

00:07:19.172 --> 00:07:20.973
and very violent

00:07:20.973 --> 00:07:22.375
picture of daily life

00:07:22.375 --> 00:07:24.677
under Israeli occupation.

00:07:24.677 --> 00:07:27.747
The Palestinians are ruled against their

00:07:27.747 --> 00:07:29.282
will by the Israelis.

00:07:29.282 --> 00:07:31.350
And in order to maintain that rule,

00:07:31.350 --> 00:07:32.084
which is

00:07:32.084 --> 00:07:33.619
violent in its nature,

00:07:33.619 --> 00:07:35.621
Israel conducts these campaigns

00:07:35.621 --> 00:07:37.623
against Palestinian resistance,

00:07:37.623 --> 00:07:38.524
which exists

00:07:38.524 --> 00:07:40.927
because the occupation exists.

00:07:40.993 --> 00:07:41.661
As you know,

00:07:41.661 --> 00:07:43.329
your reporter was reporting

00:07:43.329 --> 00:07:45.331
out of Ukraine a few moments ago

00:07:45.598 --> 00:07:46.999
and was talking about efforts

00:07:46.999 --> 00:07:49.535
to combat occupation there.

00:07:50.136 --> 00:07:51.838
It's pretty much the same

00:07:51.838 --> 00:07:53.339
when it comes to Palestinian.

00:07:53.339 --> 00:07:53.639
I do,

00:07:53.639 --> 00:07:54.307
fortunately,

00:07:54.307 --> 00:07:55.475
the international reaction

00:07:55.475 --> 00:07:56.709
is very different.

00:07:56.709 --> 00:07:57.877
I want our reporting

00:07:57.877 --> 00:07:59.445
says that the United States

00:07:59.445 --> 00:08:00.279
Biden administration

00:08:00.279 --> 00:08:01.914
is watching the situation closely,

00:08:01.914 --> 00:08:03.483
but it continues to hold the line

00:08:03.483 --> 00:08:04.951
saying that, look, Israel

00:08:04.951 --> 00:08:06.819
is entitled to safeguard its security.

00:08:06.819 --> 00:08:08.621
I also want to get to those calls

00:08:08.621 --> 00:08:09.722
from Hamas and Islamic

00:08:09.722 --> 00:08:11.190
Jihad to, in their words,

00:08:11.190 --> 00:08:12.124
strike Israel

00:08:12.124 --> 00:08:13.459
by all available means

00:08:13.459 --> 00:08:15.194
to stop the massacre.

00:08:15.194 --> 00:08:15.795
I mean,

00:08:15.795 --> 00:08:17.430
how much of a tipping point

00:08:17.430 --> 00:08:18.197
are we at here

00:08:18.197 --> 00:08:19.532
in terms of an escalation,

00:08:19.532 --> 00:08:22.134
especially, you know, all available means

00:08:22.902 --> 00:08:24.570
basically as a call to action

00:08:24.570 --> 00:08:25.805
for more violence, is it not?

00:08:27.507 --> 00:08:28.975
Well, again, I

00:08:28.975 --> 00:08:29.742
want to

00:08:30.142 --> 00:08:31.010
just bring in the

00:08:31.010 --> 00:08:32.745
Palestinian perspective here.

00:08:32.745 --> 00:08:34.213
Being ruled against your will

00:08:34.213 --> 00:08:34.780
by a foreign

